# Ordem de Consulta

## Para implementar uma Feature

Consultar obrigatoriamente:

```text
1. construction/12-fullstack-orchestrator.md      ← workflow v4.1 Full Stack
2. construction/11-feature-execution-workflow.md    ← workflow v3.2 por Workstream
   construction/16-frontend-validation-gates.md     ← gates PKG vs E2E (frontend, BUILD-02 / E2E-01)
   construction/17-frontend-e2e-behavior-policy.md  ← política specs Playwright (E2E-02)

3. construction/registry.yaml (REGISTRY-01) — descobrir Feature e Workstreams

4. feature-manifest.yaml (SSOD-01) — SSOT Feature:
   - Feature:  construction/features/<FEATURE_CODE>/feature-manifest.yaml

5. construction-state.yaml (STATE-WS-01) — SSOT por Workstream:
   - Backend:  construction/features/<FEATURE_CODE>/construction-state.yaml
   - Frontend: construction/frontend/features/<FEATURE_CODE>/construction-state.yaml
   - Agregado: computado (STATE-AGG-01) — não inferir sem ler cada Workstream

6. execution-plan.md + session.md (Snapshot imutável do Workstream ativo)

5. specs/features/ (path em manifest.specification.path)

6. specs/foundation/

7. docs/implementation/

8. docs/construction/
```

Durante PKGs: consultar `construction-state.yaml` para estado; Snapshot em `session.md` para contexto — não reler documentos já carregados (CACHE-01, RULE-CONTEXT-01).

---

## Para executar uma Sprint de Integração

Consultar obrigatoriamente:

```text
1. engineering/integration/01-integration-sprint-workflow.md   ← SSOT integração

2. integration-manifest.yaml (SSOD-INT-01) — descobrir paths:
   - Registry: engineering/integration/registry.yaml
   - Sprint:   engineering/integration/sprints/<SPRINT_ID>/integration-manifest.yaml

3. integration-state.yaml (STATE-INT-01) — estado operacional da sprint

4. integration-plan.md + integration-checklist.md

5. construction/features/registry.yaml — Features no escopo (todas FEATURE_APPROVED)

6. specs/features/ (contratos das Features no escopo)

7. docs/implementation/ e docs/construction/
```

Durante validação: consultar `integration-state.yaml` para estado; não alterar código nem especificações nesta fase (RULE-INT-02).

